(7, 'G', 'The ASL sign for letter G is made by forming a fist with the index finger pointing straight out and thumb extended.'),
(8, 'H', 'The ASL sign for letter H is made by extending the index and middle fingers together, with other fingers closed.'),
(9, 'I', 'The ASL sign for letter I is made by making a fist with only the pinky finger extended.'),
(10, 'J', 'The ASL sign for letter J is made by extending the pinky finger and tracing the letter J in the air.'),
