(78, 1, '2025-05-15 05:55:50', '2025-05-15 05:55:50', 'This image features a minimalist setup of two personal care products. On the left, there is a sleek toothbrush with a white handle and light blue accents, including soft blue bristles. On the right, a white plastic shampoo bottle with a pump dispenser is shown. The bottle has a simple, beige circular label with the text \"SHAMPOO\" written in a clean, modern font. The background is a plain, light gradient, ensuring the focus remains on the products.', 'Toothbrush and Shampoo Bottle', '', 'trash', 'open', 'closed', '', '__trashed', '', '', '2025-05-15 05:55:50', '2025-05-15 05:55:50', '', 0, 'http://localhost/wordpress/?post_type=product&#038;p=78', 0, 'product', '', 0),
