(90, 1, '2025-05-20 03:08:14', '2025-05-20 03:08:14', 'POCARI SWEAT is a health drink that contains a balance of ions (electrolytes) which resembles the natural fluid balance in the human body. Quickly and easily replenishes the water and ions that your body needs, and quenches every part of you. Refreshing and mild tasting, recommended as a \'first aid\' beverage for sports, exercise or any physical activities and various forms of mild dehydration.', 'Pocari Sweat', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'pocari-sweat', '', '', '2025-05-20 05:31:34', '2025-05-20 05:31:34', '', 0, 'http://localhost/wordpress/?post_type=product&#038;p=90', 0, 'product', '', 0),
